  "body": "<!-- Release notes template: keep it short -->\r\n## Highlights\r\n\r\nExample Tool **1.4.0** adds a [`--dry-run`](https://example.org/docs/dry-run) flag and <b>faster</b> imports.\r\n\r\n![screenshot](https://example.org/shot.png)\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* feat: add `--dry-run` flag to the import command by @alice-example in https://github.com/example-org/example-tool/pull/41\r\n* fix: imports are 2x faster on large folders by @bob-example in https://github.com/example-org/example-tool/pull/42\r\n* docs: explain the _config_ file &amp; its defaults by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/example-org/example-tool/pull/43\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npip install example-tool==1.4.0\r\n```\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @bob-example made their first contribution in https://github.com/example-org/example-tool/pull/42\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/example-org/example-tool/compare/v1.3.0...v1.4.0",
